  "note": "Lean bounds the tail as a geometric series over 4.4-windows, with no counterpart of the integral. Erratum: The first line of (9.91) prints 8.39/(4π) = 0.66765 ≤ 0.668, but (9.89)'s 8.45 gives 8.45/(4π) = 0.67243, which carries through as 0.4646, 0.9142, 1.7123 instead of 0.462, 0.909, 1.71. (checked by `scripts/checks/eq_9_91.py`)."
